sequenceDiagram
    participant Ops
    participant API as Admin API
    participant Loan as Loan Application Service
    participant DB as Loan DB
    participant Kafka as Event Bus
    participant WF as Workflow Service

    Ops->>API: Approve / Reject loan
    API->>Loan: Submit ops decision
    Loan->>DB: Persist ops decision
    DB-->>Loan: Commit success
    Loan->>Kafka: Publish OPS_DECISION_EVENT
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Update workflow state
    Loan-->>API: Action acknowledged
    API-->>Ops: Decision recorded
